<title>ITALY: Bergamo air cargo traffic rises in April.</title>
<headline>Bergamo air cargo traffic rises in April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bergamo airport authority said April</p>
<p>cargo traffic totalled 4,815 tonnes compared to 3,511 in the same</p>
<p>month last year.</p>
<p>Year to date tonnage was 17,185 tonnes against 13,925 in</p>
<p>1996.</p>
<p>Aircraft Movements     April 97     April 96    Year	  Year</p>
<p>							     todate 97 todate 96</p>
<p>On Line		    389	    162	   1776	   576</p>
<p>Charter		    164	    164	    687	   615</p>
<p>Cargo Couriers	   624	    577	   2384	  2446</p>
<p>All Cargo		   12		6	     14	    20</p>
<p>Other			 93	    128	    547	   698</p>
<p>Total Commercial	1282	   1037	   5408	  4355</p>
<p>Aviation</p>
<p>Total General	    755	    765	   2468	  2378</p>
<p>Aviation</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
